  "slug": "food-safety-inspection-checklist-form",
  "title": "Food Safety Inspection Checklist Form",
  "subtitle": "Food Safety prepare the inspection, examine domain-specific conditions, record findings, assign corrections, decide status, and close the review.",
  "description": "An original, workflow-complete food safety inspection checklist covering identity and routing, domain observations and evidence, accountable decisions, exceptions and escalation, and completion handoff without replacing qualified judgment.",
  "use_case": "Use for a planned or triggered inspection that must preserve observed condition, finding severity, correction ownership, and an authorized disposition. The record is owned by the food-safety program owner and closes only after evidence, exceptions, disposition, and the next accountable handoff are documented.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
